SUMMARY:Get paid: Find a part-time job
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an engaging workshop that demystifies student emp
 loyment\, including work-study. Meet staff from the student employment of
 fice to get an inside scoop on how to find opportunities to not only grow
  your bank account but also your skillsets. Learn about best practices fo
 r searching and applying for part-time jobs.  All students welcome.
