 emystifies student employment\, including work-study. Meet staff from the
  student employment office to get an inside scoop on how to find opportun
 ities to not only grow your bank account but also your skillsets. Learn a
 bout best practices for searching and applying for part-time jobs.</p><p>
   All students welcome.</p>
