BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU La Casa Latino Cultural Center
DTSTART:20260916T230000Z
DTEND:20260917T000000Z
LOCATION:La Casa/Latino Cultural Center
GEO:39.168732;-86.525021
SUMMARY:Nuestras Raices: We All Have a Story
DESCRIPTION:Nuestras Raíces is an open mic and family-style gathering th
 at celebrates personal traditions\, cultures\, and histories. This progra
 m honors our familias\, those who came before us whose stories and memori
 es help preserve and illuminate the diverse experiences of our communitie
 s across generations.  Join us in sharing your own stories\, mementos\, p
 hotographs\, songs\, poems\, writings\, and other meaningful pieces conne
 cted to you. Together\, we create space to connect\, reflect\, and celebr
 ate the roots that shape who we are.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Nuestras Raíces is an open mic and fam
 ily-style gathering that celebrates personal traditions\, cultures\, and 
 histories. This program honors our <em>familias</em>\, those who came bef
 ore us whose stories and memories help preserve and illuminate the divers
 e experiences of our communities across generations.</p><p>  Join us in s
 haring your own stories\, mementos\, photographs\, songs\, poems\, writin
 gs\, and other meaningful pieces connected to you. Together\, we create s
 pace to connect\, reflect\, and celebrate the roots that shape who we are
 .</p>
UID:20260916T230000Z-2324803@events.iu.edu
