SUMMARY:Latine Voices: Engagement\, Representation\, and Political Life
DESCRIPTION:Join Dr. Vanessa Cruz Nichols (Department of Political Scienc
 e) for an engaging exploration of Latine political participation in the U
 nited States. Drawing on her research and expertise\, Dr. Cruz Nichols wi
 ll examine the many ways Latine communities engage in civic and political
  life—from voting and grassroots organizing to advocacy and community l
 eadership.
