 gaging exploration of Latine political participation in the United States
 . Drawing on her research and expertise\, Dr. Cruz Nichols will examine t
 he many ways Latine communities engage in civic and political life—from
  voting and grassroots organizing to advocacy and community leadership.</
 span></p>
