 d a gathering. Co-sponsored by Indiana University Student Government\, La
 tino Studies\, Center for Latin American &amp\; Caribbean Studies\, First
  Nations Educational &amp\; Cultural Center and La Casa.We Will Be Jaguar
 s by Nemonte Nenquimo is a powerful memoir about an Indigenous Waorani le
 ader's fight to protect her people\, culture\, and Amazon rainforest home
 land from exploitation and destruction.
